  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "Planned development entitlements complete; individual residential projects to be submitted later. City page calls it a mix of homes, townhomes, condos and apartments, with 135,000 sf commercial. APNs come from CEQAnet, which also lists 728-37-025 and -028, not in the county parcel layer.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001422",
        "SRC-001423",
        "SRC-001424"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City and CEQAnet describe Phase 2 as 498 residential units (homes, townhomes, condos and apartments), 135,000 sq ft of retail and a 140-room hotel, with the area redesignated Mixed Use Flex. The 2005 EIR had planned about 350,000 sq ft of retail for Phase 2.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002169",
        "SRC-001424"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CEQAnet splits the 33.5 acres as 23 residential and 10 commercial (NOP) and as 20 residential and 13.5 commercial (SEIR). The NOD lists 69 total acres.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001424",
        "SRC-002167",
        "SRC-002168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Per the NOD, the Council approved a reduced General Plan Amendment area tied to the residential uses and reduced height, and moved some uses from permitted to conditional. Residential uses are in the northern and middle portions; retail and hotel in the southern portion.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "County parcel 728-37-024 has situs 1107 Cochrane Rd; the other listed parcels show no situs address.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001098"
      ]
    }
  ],
